WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:06.080
Professor Zhang 
Changping's
Close Reading

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:07.480
Professor Zhang Changping
Department of Archeaology, Wuhan University
Visiting Scholar, Harvard University

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:17.720
For this particular ding, as you can see the two handles and two feet are parallel.

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:20.800
This means it is the front side of the tripod.

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:27.720
For an object like this, from the front we can see a complete pattern.

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:32.120
More importantly, the place where the rear foot meets the body of the bronze

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:35.800
often will have an inscription.

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:40.360
Thus, a round vessel will often still have a front and back side.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:44.000
This particular ding has an inscription on it.

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:54.320
Many scholars believe that inscriptions from the Shang-Zhou period are clan insignia. 

00:00:54.280 --> 00:01:02.480
From a decorative perspective, we can see that the patterns on this ding

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:05.560
have undergone nearly a thousand years of development.

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:09.800
Thus its ornamentations appear extremely sophisticated and delicate.

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:13.680
In fact, we can see different levels of ornamentation.

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:23.240
At first glance, we can see that this ding looks like an animal mask.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:29.520
We can see that it appears to be in the form of a beast.

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:34.680
For example we can see its horns, its ears, etc. created through mid-relief

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:40.360
We can see that on the mid-relief there are very delicate patterns.

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:45.360
There are also many delicate patterns on the background.

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:55.200
In terms of ornamentation, there are background patterns, 

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:58.560
there are mid-relief patterns, and there are patterns on the mid-relief.

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:01.640
Thus it has three different layers of patterns.

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:08.240
This reflects the creator's drive to push the decorative potential to the extreme.

